    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n20 Bushfield Lawns is a well-presented three bedroom semi-detached home within a tranquil and verdant setting - this recently painted home comes to the market with no-onward chain.\n\nBushfield is located just off the Green Isle Hotel, giving easy access to the Naas Road and Belgard Road and is a very quiet, mature development, filled with trees and green areas. Clondalkin Village is less than 10 minutes' walk, while local schools and buses are right on the doorstep.Dublin City centre is a 25 minute drive and Dublin Airport can be accessed in 15 minutes.Accommodation comprises; living room, kitchen/dining room, guest WC, three bedrooms (two double, one with an ensuite) and a family bathroom. To the rear lies a sunny garden and the property majorly benefits from having no onward chain.This is a fantastic opportunity to purchase a real family home with everything right on your doorstep.Call or email for viewing details."
      },
